## Why This Is Asked
Tests a practical, production-ready approach to multi-tenant inference, with per-tenant routing, canary risk controls, and drift/latency monitoring within a VPC-bound data-residency model.

## Key Concepts
- SageMaker Endpoint variants and traffic weighting
- Per-tenant routing and isolation
- PrivateLink data lake access
- Canary rollout and rollback triggers
- Drift and latency monitoring, autoscaling, and cost control

## Code Example
